    "description": "Bendos Action Figure Lot - 8 Pieces\nKid Galaxy, Mixed Series\n1999-2001, Factory Sealed / New In Packaging\nThis collection features eight vintage Bendos posable action figures by Kid Galaxy, dating from the late 1990s and early 2000s. Known for their \"bend 'em, pose 'em\" flexibility and imaginative character designs, Bendos became a beloved collector's line for their unique aesthetic and tactile play value. This lot includes a diverse range of characters from multiple series, all remaining in their original retail packaging.\nFigures Included:\nChops Martial Artist (#1606) - Series 3, Original Boxed Packaging\nMistletoe Elf (#245) - Series 3, Original Tube Packaging\nSwat Alien (#064) - Series 2, Original Tube Packaging\nBogey Golfer (#265) - Series 3, Original Tube Packaging\nWinnie Horse Rider (#084) - Original Tube Packaging\nBen Dough Chef (#235) - Series 3, Original Tube Packaging\nAllie Best Friend (#225) - Series 3, Original Tube Packaging\nLinkbug Snowboarder (#020) - Original Tube Packaging\nCondition:\nAll eight figures are factory sealed in their original packaging. The clear plastic tubes exhibit typical shelf wear including light surface scratches and minor yellowing consistent with age. The cardboard box for \"Chops\" shows minor edge wear and light creasing at the top flap. Original retail price stickers are present on several packages. Figures appear in mint condition through the clear windows.\nState Tax:\nGoodwill Industries of the Southern Piedmont is required by law to collect state taxes.\nPayment Extensions -\nWe will no longer extend any payment deadlines.\nITEMS ARE NOT OFFICIALLY APPRAISED, CERTIFIED OR AUTHENTICATED UNLESS OTHERWISE SPECIFIED. IF AN ITEM IS AUTHENTICATED, IT IS BY LEGITMARK AND WILL HAVE A COA QR CODE. SPORTS/ENTERTAINMENT MEMORABILIA IS AUTHENTICATED BY JSA AND WILL STATE IN THE LISTING.\nPlease use the Shipping Calculator on the listing page PRIOR to placing your bid.\nPLEASE SEE SELLER TAB FOR: REFUNDS/RETURNS.\nIMPORTANT NOTES: SEE SELLER TAB\nPLEASE SEE SHIPPING TAB FOR SHIPPING/PICKUP INFORMATION.\nDisclaimer:\nTitles, categories, and item specifics may be generated with the assistance of AI, and should be considered informational only. While efforts are made to ensure accuracy, errors may occur. Photos and written description should be relied upon when evaluating the item. Please ask any questions PRIOR to bidding, as ALL sales are FINAL unless the item is significantly not as described. Most Item(s) are pre-owned and may show normal signs of use, wear, storage, or handling. General polishing/cleaning is recommended before use. Items may have odors from previous ownership, storage environments, detergents, perfumes, smoke, or other scents. Jewelry item(s) are tested using a Thermo Scientific Niton DXL Precious Metal Analyzer. The Thermo Scientific Niton DXL desktop x-ray lab delivers fast and accurate XRF-based precious metal analysis. All gemstones are tested on a Presidium Duo Tester. This equipment CANNOT determine between natural, lab created & synthetic gemstones. We are not able to test any Pearls. We DO NOT open ANY watches. ALL items consist of used, donated items and have not been cleaned, serviced, or tested for full functionality unless otherwise stated. We DO NOT open or break down items, therefore unseen flaws or imperfections may not be shown or mentioned. Items are sold AS-IS, AS-FOUND, and may not be returned for any reason. We are NOT experts in any field. By bidding or purchasing, you acknowledge and accept these conditions.",
